  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2eda6d79",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "Check for gaps in the date sequence (should be ~1 year of daily data)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 38,
   "id": "f21ca2de",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "all_dates = pd.date_range(start=transactions['DATE'].min(), end=transactions['DATE'].max())\n",
    "missing_dates = all_dates.difference(transactions['DATE'].unique())\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "id": "da44df34",
   "source": [
    "Count transactions per day and plot them over time, to check the data looks like a normal full year with no big gaps or spikes."
