  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a0615f75",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Investigate the customer behind the outlier"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "id": "23600a6b",
   "source": [
    "Find every transaction made by that same outlier customer, to see the full pattern of their unusual buying \u2014 not just the one flagged row."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 53,
   "id": "b0fcc189",
   "metadata": {},
