  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "id": "191f5755",
   "source": [
    "Join the transaction data and customer data together using the loyalty card number, so every purchase row also has the customer's lifestage and spending segment attached."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 62,
   "id": "867b19d5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
